{"drafts":[{"assumptions":["Use Google authentication for authorized Folio3 accounts as stated in I-1; the email/password-only default in ASM-1 conflicts with that explicit requirement and is not applied.","A missing corporate employee profile blocks dashboard access; a recoverable error allows retry or support contact (ASM-2, ASM-15).","For a returning employee whose vehicle profile is incomplete, show the dashboard prompt and block vehicle-dependent actions until a plate is registered, following ASM-16 rather than the conflicting routing default in ASM-3.","The 30-day scheduling horizon counts calendar dates in the office timezone; dates are eligible for parking operation only when present in the administrator-maintained operating-day calendar (ASM-10, ASM-17).","The office-local fixed Monday report time is configurable; exact stakeholder addresses and time are configured by a Parking Administrator (ASM-25, ASM-26).","The LPR and indicator are the designated entrance systems using their selected vendor-supported interfaces; their specific vendor protocols are not defined here (ASM-9, ASM-20, ASM-21).","Q-2 requires administrators to reverse a claimed release and record the intervention but does not define whether that reversal revokes the claimant's entrance authorization."],"nfrs":[{"id":"NFR-1","metric":"100% of applicable WCAG 2.1 AA success criteria pass a documented conformance audit for the main employee and guard-facing flows.","text":"The employee mobile application and guard-facing view shall conform to WCAG 2.1 AA for the main flows."}],"outOfScope":["Full audit-trail history beyond the expressly recorded release, claim, intervention, verification, and utilization records (ASM-12, ASM-28).","Custom report builder beyond filtered lists and CSV export (ASM-11, ASM-25).","Application and notification languages other than English (ASM-13, ASM-29)."],"requirements":[{"acceptance":[{"given":"A Google authentication callback identifies an authorized Folio3 employee account","id":"AC-REQ-1.1","level":"api","then":"The response status is 200 and the returned session identifies that employee","when":"The callback is submitted to the sign-in endpoint"},{"given":"A Google authentication callback identifies a personal Gmail account or an account from another provider","id":"AC-REQ-1.2","level":"api","then":"The response status is 401 and no employee session record exists","when":"The callback is submitted to the sign-in endpoint"}],"ears":"The Folio3 parking system shall grant an employee session only when Google authentication identifies an account authorized for Folio3.","id":"REQ-1","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-1"],"stability":0.94},{"acceptance":[{"given":"The corporate directory or current parking records contain updated values for an employee","id":"AC-REQ-2.1","level":"api","then":"The employee profile row contains the refreshed values from those records","when":"The employee signs in or an administrator saves the source-record update"}],"ears":"When an employee signs in or an administrator updates employee or parking source records, the Folio3 parking system shall refresh the employee profile and current parking assignment from the corporate directory and current parking records.","id":"REQ-2","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-1","ASM-4"],"stability":0.78},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Google authentication succeeds but the corporate employee profile is missing or unavailable","id":"AC-REQ-3.1","level":"api","then":"The response contains a profile-retrieval error, no dashboard data is returned, and the error field includes retry or support-contact guidance","when":"The employee requests the dashboard"}],"ears":"If the corporate employee profile cannot be found or retrieved, then the Folio3 parking system shall deny dashboard access and return a recoverable profile-retrieval error with retry or support-contact guidance.","id":"REQ-3","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-1","ASM-2","ASM-15"],"stability":0.92},{"acceptance":[{"given":"The directory and parking records contain a dedicated employee, an assigned floor, and registered vehicle details","id":"AC-REQ-4.1","level":"api","then":"The employee row contains the ID, name, dedicated-parking status, and floor, and each returned vehicle record contains its plate and stored make, model, and color values","when":"The employee profile is refreshed"}],"ears":"When a dedicated employee profile is refreshed, the Folio3 parking system shall populate the employee ID, employee name, dedicated-parking status, assigned floor, and registered vehicle records with license plate and any stored make, model, and color.","id":"REQ-4","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-1","ASM-4"],"stability":0.87},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A non-dedicated employee has no registered vehicle record","id":"AC-REQ-5.1","level":"api","then":"The response status is 422 and the error field identifies that at least one license plate must be registered","when":"The employee submits a vehicle-dependent parking action"},{"given":"A non-dedicated first-time employee has no registered vehicle record","id":"AC-REQ-5.2","level":"manual","then":"The screen shown is the vehicle-registration screen and its form requires a license plate value","when":"The employee opens the first-login flow"}],"ears":"When a non-dedicated employee signs in for the first time without a registered vehicle, the Folio3 parking system shall require registration of at least one license plate before granting access to vehicle-dependent parking actions.","id":"REQ-5","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-1"],"stability":0.91},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A returning employee has no registered license plate","id":"AC-REQ-6.1","level":"api","then":"The response contains dashboard data and a vehicle-registration prompt field","when":"The employee requests the dashboard"},{"given":"A returning employee has no registered license plate","id":"AC-REQ-6.2","level":"api","then":"The response status is 422 and the error field identifies the missing plate","when":"The employee submits a vehicle-dependent parking action"}],"ears":"When a returning employee has no complete vehicle profile, the Folio3 parking system shall show the dashboard with a vehicle-registration prompt and block vehicle-dependent parking actions until at least one license plate is registered.","id":"REQ-6","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-1","ASM-16"],"stability":0.85},{"acceptance":[{"given":"An employee owns a vehicle record","id":"AC-REQ-7.1","level":"api","then":"The returned vehicle record reflects the requested change","when":"The employee adds, updates, or deactivates that record through the vehicle API"},{"given":"An employee attempts to change another employee's vehicle record","id":"AC-REQ-7.2","level":"api","then":"The response status is 403 and the other employee's vehicle row is unchanged","when":"The employee submits the change through the vehicle API"},{"given":"A Parking Administrator is authenticated","id":"AC-REQ-7.3","level":"api","then":"The returned vehicle record reflects the requested change","when":"The administrator adds, updates, or deactivates an employee vehicle record"}],"ears":"The Folio3 parking system shall allow an employee to add, update, or deactivate only their own vehicle records and allow a Parking Administrator to manage employee vehicle records.","id":"REQ-7","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-1","Q-6"],"stability":0.94},{"acceptance":[{"given":"An iOS device and an Android device are available","id":"AC-REQ-8.1","level":"manual","then":"The sign-in screen is displayed on both platforms","when":"A tester installs and opens the employee application on each device"}],"ears":"The Folio3 parking system shall provide the employee mobile application on both iOS and Android.","id":"REQ-8","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-1"],"stability":0.9},{"acceptance":[{"given":"An employee has a dedicated assignment and the date is marked as an operating day","id":"AC-REQ-9.1","level":"api","then":"The response status field is Reserved and the assignment row