urrently for the final available space","id":"AC-REQ-16.1","level":"api","then":"Exactly one response is successful, the other response contains a conflict error and refreshed availability, and only one claim row exists for the space","when":"Both claim requests are processed"},{"given":"An employee already has a temporary claim for a date","id":"AC-REQ-16.2","level":"api","then":"The response status is 409 and the count of that employee's claim rows for the date remains 1","when":"The employee submits another claim for that date"}],"ears":"The Folio3 parking system shall allocate each released space to the first successfully committed eligible claim, reject competing claims for an already allocated space, and allow at most one claim per employee per date.","id":"REQ-16","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-3","ASM-6","Q-4","ASM-18"],"stability":0.94},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Released spaces have known available and claimed statuses","id":"AC-REQ-17.1","level":"api","then":"The response count equals the number of claimable spaces","when":"An eligible employee requests parking availability"},{"given":"An eligible employee opens the parking availability screen","id":"AC-REQ-17.2","level":"manual","then":"The screen displays the current available-space count","when":"Available spaces exist"}],"ears":"The Folio3 parking system shall return the current available-space count to employees without dedicated parking and display that count in the application.","id":"REQ-17","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-3"],"stability":0.89},{"acceptance":[{"given":"An employee has multiple registered vehicles and an available space exists","id":"AC-REQ-18.1","level":"api","then":"The returned claim record contains the selected vehicle ID and only that vehicle's plate is present in the claim authorization record","when":"The employee claims a space and selects one vehicle"},{"given":"An employee has registered vehicles but submits a claim without selecting one","id":"AC-REQ-18.2","level":"api","then":"The