ation","id":"AC-REQ-24.2","level":"api","then":"The verification response is unauthorized and no call activating the green indicator is recorded","when":"The entrance verification request is processed"}],"ears":"When the entrance LPR system reports a non-stickered vehicle, the Folio3 parking system shall normalize plate case and permitted spacing, require an exact match to a current-day temporary authorization, and activate the green indicator only for a match.","id":"REQ-24","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-4","ASM-7","ASM-9","ASM-19"],"stability":0.88},{"acceptance":[{"given":"The entrance LPR system cannot read a plate","id":"AC-REQ-25.1","level":"api","then":"The verification response is unauthorized, the indicator remains off, and an attempt row contains an unreadable result and available timestamp","when":"The detection is processed"},{"given":"The camera, indicator, connection, or authorization service is unavailable","id":"AC-REQ-25.2","level":"api","then":"No green-indicator activation call is recorded and a security-alert call is recorded","when":"The entrance verification flow detects the failure"},{"given":"A service failure was detected while the authorization service was unavailable","id":"AC-REQ-25.3","level":"api","then":"A failure row with the available timestamp and failure result is returned by the attempt-record query","when":"The service is restored and failure records are flushed"}],"ears":"If a plate is unreadable or the camera, indicator, connection, or authorization service is unavailable, then the Folio3 parking system shall fail closed, keep the green indicator inactive, alert security for a service failure, and record the failure when service is restored.","id":"REQ-25","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-4","ASM-8","ASM-9","ASM-19","ASM-21"],"stability":0.86},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A successful or unsuccessful verification attempt has been processed","id":"AC-REQ-26.1","level":"api","then":"The returned row contains a timestamp, plate when available,